 ## Best Practices
 
-1. **Always convert units before plotting**: mdtraj returns nm / ps / radians. Multiply by 10 (Å), divide by 1000 (ns), wrap in `np.degrees()` (deg). Forgetting this is the #1 cause of "my RMSD looks 10× too small".
-
-   ```python
